    "short dashed cap line at the first peak (transition state)",
    "ΔG‡ vertical double-headed arrow between reactant level and first peak",
    "cationic intermediate structure in the trough: partly unsaturated six-membered ring with H and magenta Br bonded to the same carbon, plus sign above",
    "second, lower peak (second transition state)",
    "product dashed energy level below the reactant level",
    "ΔG° small double-headed arrow spanning the reactant-to-product gap",
    "substitution product structure: bromobenzene + plus sign + 'HBr' in magenta, labeled 'Substitution'",
    "magenta addition branch curve rising from the trough over its own maximum",
    "addition endpoint structure: bracketed dibrominated ring with two H's and two magenta Br's, labeled 'Addition' and '(does not occur)' in magenta"
